d a generous walk-in closet. Two additional bedrooms provide ample space for family members or guests, ensuring everyone has their own private oasis. Enclosed by a privacy fence, the backyard offers the perfect setting for outdoor relaxation and entertainment. Unwind on the covered porch with your morning coffee or host summer barbecues with loved ones, all while enjoying the tranquility and privacy of your surroundings. Conveniently located in Killeen, this home offers easy access to shopping, dining, parks, and top-rated schools. Don't miss this opportunity to make this charming residence your own\r\n\r\n2 full bath\r\n\r\nFor more information, please contact: \r\nRobert Herrings\r\nJR Rentals & Property Management\r\n254-547-9994 or robertherringsjr@gmail.com\r\n\r\nYou can also text 151754 to 46835\r\n\r\nAGENT SOCIAL\r\n--------------------\r\nWebsite: http://forthoodrentalproperties.com/\r\nShowcase: https://view.paradym.com/s/Robert-Herrings-JR-Rentals--Property-Management/284510\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100063905801693\r\n\r\nCOMPANY SOCIAL\r\n--------------------\r\nWebsite: https://www.forthoodrealestate.com/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/Century21PremierRealtors/\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/c21pbroker\r\nLinkedIn: https://www.Linkedin.com/in/hrherrings/\r\nPinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/jrherrings/", "channel_id": "UCZvWg96vLbA3eGHCwnf3RRQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZvWg96vLbA3eGHCwnf3RRQ", "duration": 203, "view_count": 2, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QFmvNee5MOw", "categories": ["Travel & Events"], "tags": ["303 Atlas Avenue", "76542", "JR Rentals Property Managemen", "Killeen TX 76542", "Paradym", "Robert Herrings", "Video Tour", "Virtual Tour", "VisualTour", "home for sale", "homes for sale in Killeen", "real estate"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr